# .gitignore snippet — Corporate PAI

# Use this in any corp repo you work in, to prevent accidental commits of
# PAI memory, learning files, or user-authored content.

# If you ever link ~/.pai/ into a repo (unusual), these patterns prevent
# accidentally staging personal/corporate memory.
.pai/
**/.pai/
**/MEMORY/LEARNING/
**/MEMORY/WORK/
**/MEMORY/RELATIONSHIP/
**/ratings.jsonl
**/startup-digest.md

# User-authored PAI identity files (never commit)
**/USER/ABOUTME.md
**/USER/DAIDENTITY.md
**/USER/AISTEERINGRULES.md
**/USER/TELOS/

# Sidecar logs
**/pai/logs/
